{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/untitled.png?t=1748857681\" />Welcome to Surf 'n Turf</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world made of food and you are Munch, a lizard cook ready for an adventure...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Surf 'n Turf</strong> is an Island-hopping, <strong>dish-making</strong> <strong>3D platformer</strong>. In Surf 'n Turf, you are a little lizard chef that gathers ingredients by hopping along islands with an expansive move set. Twirl and flip your way to the delicious-est dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/MunchNoBackGround-ezgif.com-gif-maker.gif?t=1748857681\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/PlatformingBanner.png?t=1748857681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/HighQualityLogo.gif?t=1748857681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Munch is quite the acrobat, and you can utilize his skills to traverse the platforming challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/CookingBanner.png?t=1748857681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/cooking.gif?t=1748857681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Munch is a chef, so use his culinary skills to make the best dishes the world has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/SurfingBanner.png?t=1748857681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/surfing_.gif?t=1748857681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Munch can go fast on a surfboard and hit some sick tricks. Making traveling to the next island a breeze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/EndingBanner.png?t=1748857681\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is the goal?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Surf 'n Turf you go around islands, where you find hungry, occasionally picky characters to make food for. You have limited time to prepare a dish and gather all the ingredients, watch the timer! While making the dish, you are managing:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The time that's running out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The specific ingredients you have to find for the dish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The difficult obstacles that you have to platform your way across.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These challenges will test your time management, platforming, and decision-making skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You win the challenge when you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get enough points with the dish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Got the correct ingredients for your customer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Served the dish before the time ran out.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514850?t=1748857681","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/5d7635e72a34f78e1c0c6dabc2fd51897825afc2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748857681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/245969ca1d09116160c5b840a76f1eda262f816f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748857681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/245969ca1d09116160c5b840a76f1eda262f816f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748857681","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/untitled.png?t=1748857681\" />Welcome to Surf 'n Turf</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world made of food and you are Munch, a lizard cook ready for an adventure...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Surf 'n Turf</strong> is an Island-hopping, <strong>dish-making</strong> <strong>3D platformer</strong>. In Surf 'n Turf, you are a little lizard chef that gathers ingredients by hopping along islands with an expansive move set. Twirl and flip your way to the delicious-est dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/MunchNoBackGround-ezgif.com-gif-maker.gif?t=1748857681\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/PlatformingBanner.png?t=1748857681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/HighQualityLogo.gif?t=1748857681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Munch is quite the acrobat, and you can utilize his skills to traverse the platforming challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/CookingBanner.png?t=1748857681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/cooking.gif?t=1748857681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Munch is a chef, so use his culinary skills to make the best dishes the world has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/SurfingBanner.png?t=1748857681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/surfing_.gif?t=1748857681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Munch can go fast on a surfboard and hit some sick tricks. Making traveling to the next island a breeze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/EndingBanner.png?t=1748857681\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is the goal?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Surf 'n Turf you go around islands, where you find hungry, occasionally picky characters to make food for. You have limited time to prepare a dish and gather all the ingredients, watch the timer! While making the dish, you are managing:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The time that's running out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The specific ingredients you have to find for the dish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The difficult obstacles that you have to platform your way across.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These challenges will test your time management, platforming, and decision-making skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You win the challenge when you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get enough points with the dish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Got the correct ingredients for your customer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Served the dish before the time ran out.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Startaste Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/4661ea09557ae09298b4a521853461441047be16/header.jpg?t=1748857681","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Surf 'n Turf","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-6700HQ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 960M<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li>